Episode 12: Everyone and Umaru

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:36.750
Umaru, what do you want for dinner tonight?

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.370
I can have anything at all? Well then, I want pizza!

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:44.830
I didn't say "anything," but still... Pizza, huh?

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.370
Step 1 will be a brick oven.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:51.160
What makes you think we have to start

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:51.160
by making a brick oven?

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.870
We can just have it delivered.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.540
Why do you always take the easy way out?

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:58.830
Making things by hand gives it a taste all its own. 

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:03.160
Huh? But delivery pizza was handmade

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:03.160
by the people at the store, right? 

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:09.250
If I can get some delicious stuff

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:09.250
without having to make it myself, that's fine by me!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:12.830
I mean, look, Big Brother! Look at all this pizza!

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.040
I see. So that's your thought process, huh?

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.540
IN THAT CASE! 

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.500
