00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.200
What's got him so much more fired up than usual...?

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:40.910
Stir, stir, stir, stir!

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:42.910
Whisk, whisk, whisk, whisk!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.950
