00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.410
Cake! But...

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:21.450
I'm sorry, Umaru! My family actually said

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:21.450
we should all get together this year!

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.790
And my mother made a reservation at a restaurant. 

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:29.620
It would have been even more fun

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:29.620
if Kirie and Sylphin could have made it, huh?

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:30.830
Yeah... 

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:35.200
Still, my brother will be happy that you've come. 

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.370
Huh?! H-he'll be happy?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:43.160
Yup! He said that making food

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:43.160
for a Christmas party makes it extra special.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.410
Huh? I-I guess so, yes. 

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.160
I-I'm happy too.

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:54.660
I haven't given Taihei a present since his birthday. 

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:58.000
There's so much I can't thank him enough for...

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:04.410
You got my brother a present?!

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.200
Yes! And there's one for you as well.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.750
O-oh, thank you!

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:12.160
What will YOU be giving your brother?

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:18.410
I thought maybe you and I

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:18.410
could buy him a present together.  

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.660
Oh, well, if you don't mind.  

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.790
I tried thinking of what to give him, but it was so hard...

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.120
What did you get for him?

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.790
U-um, well...

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:34.000
Ah! I'm sure he'll like that! 

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:37.540
Hmm, but what should I get him?

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:43.290
It didn't occur to me to get HIM a present. 

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.700
What would he even like?

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.410
Yeah, that looks great.  

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.500
That will be my present to you, Ebina. 

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.450
No, I couldn't! 

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.160
It's my pleasure. 

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.500
I've always thought a cap would really suit you. 

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.410
I-I'm not so sure...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.290
HATS

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.290
BAGS

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.870
Thank you very much!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:16.950
Thank you, Umaru. So, I guess it's my turn. 

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.910
This is your present!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.870
You brought it with you? Thank you!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.620
Can I open it?

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:27.450
O-okay. But, actually I...

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.040
Ah! This...

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:33.370
I've always thought a cap would really suit you.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.910
So it's a cap exchange party?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.660
Looks like it...

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.250
What should I do? This is so much fun.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.910
I never thought giving and receiving presents

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.910
could be this much fun.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:56.910
I wonder what sort of present

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:56.910
would make Big Brother happy.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.410
Merry Christmas, Big Brother! 

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.370
Ch-Ch-Ch-Christmas!

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:15.120
Whoa! Wh-what the-?!

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:15.120
I thought you'd be waiting at the house. 

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.660
The both of us ambushed you!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.330
H-h-h-ello!

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.790
Nice to see you, Ebina. 

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.580
I bought you a present, Big Brother!

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.330
Huh?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.910
Here! It's a brand-new frying pan!

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.330
A-and an apron. 

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.120
Thank you. That makes me happy. 

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:41.450
Well, let's all go buy things for tonight's dinner.  

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:45.250
But before that, what kind of present

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:45.250
do you think you'd like, Ebina?

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:48.750
Huh?! A-a present from YOU?!

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:51.910
Just don't forget about mine, Big Brother!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.620
My younger sister Hikari is a little strange. 

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.410
Hikariiin.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.410
HIKARIIII                                       IIIIIIIIN

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.290
First off, she's a slob. 

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:06.500
She loves bread, and is always snacking... 

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:08.950
And for some reason, she likes spinning around. 

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.250
Stop that, Hikari!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.830
DECEMBER 22nd

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.000
When did she start to get like that?

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.580
I feel like she's been hiding something from me recently.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.620
Is this a rebellious phase? She's that old already? 

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.290
I guess it's our home environment. 

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.120
Maybe it's all my fault...

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:38.000
10 YEARS PRIOR

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.000
I'm home. 

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:39.950
Big Sister!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:44.660
When will that Big Brother from before be coming back?

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:45.750
Huh?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:48.620
I want to see Big Brother again.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.040
L-look, it was a coincidence

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.040
he came here in the first place.  

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.870
But you both go to the same school, don't you?

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.750
Oh, no. She's being really pushy today!

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.330
CERTIFICATE OF ACHIEVEMENT

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:02.330
KANAU KONGO

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.250
He's at the top of his class?

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.120
I'm taking AP classes while he's in the regular curriculum.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.040
It was the award ceremony

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.040
that led us to becoming friends.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:14.330
And he gave me so many compliments,

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:14.330
saying how well I'd done!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.200
Would Big Brother praise me if I got an award too?

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:23.200
I think Taihei got the same sense of destiny!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:23.200
Of two geniuses colliding!

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.410
A FEW MONTHS PRIOR

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.750
Wh-what?!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.160
You were picked as the top student, and got an award?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.120
Yup.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.160
Hikari, you...

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:40.200
You're my little sister all right! You're a genius!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.160
I want to be praised. 

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:47.080
I'll do it! I will! You've done so well, Hikari!

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.120
I want... Big Brother to praise me. 

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.000
Huh? B-Big Brother?

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:58.450
Yes. With this award, he will praise me. 

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.450
WHAT DID YOU SAY?!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:05.120
I want... Big Brother to praise me.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.370
Just wait, Hikari. I'm going to get you

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.370
the greatest Christmas present of all!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.790
Calm yourself, Kanau. This is no big deal. 

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.500
You're just inviting him over for Christmas for a little bit.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.160
Inviting him... to my house?

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.160
Say, you got any plans tonight?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:34.580
It's Christmas Eve but you're free, right?

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.450
I'm having dinner with my family.  

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:40.830
You two go home and spend time with your families.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.250
I can't!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.450
There's no way. No way!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:55.870
If I couldn't even ask him to go out to do something,

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:55.870
there's no way I could ask him to my HOUSE!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:03.290
I never learned how to invite people over

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:03.290
in my AP classes!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:07.700
I'm home...

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.660
Welcome back, Big Sister. 

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:14.700
Hikari, it will be Christmas in two days, so...

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:18.200
How about you and I have some cake

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:18.200
and watch a movie?

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.330
Are you going to rent one again?

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.160
Eh?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:32.120
Last time, you went out to rent a movie

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:32.120
when I was asleep and spent Christmas on your own. 

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:38.700
N-N-NOOOOO! SHE SAW MEEEEE!

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:44.250
Happy...

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.830
...New Year!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.830
Heartfelt wishes for a good year.  

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.870
Indeed!

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:56.700
HAPPY

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:56.700
NEW YEAR,

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:56.700
INDEED

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.410
Thanks for inviting us over today. 

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:57.620
Your house is amazing, Sylphin.

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:57.620
It's the picture of the New Year!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.870
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.870
Hyaa! Hyaa! Hyaa! Hyaa! Hyaa! Hyaa! Hyaa!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:05.790
I like the mood within Japan during the New Year indeed!

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.790
"Mood"?

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.790
How can I put this?

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:14.040
The stores are closed, and you can

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:14.040
lounge about as much as you like!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.250
I get that!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:16.830
Shubatan!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.080
Shubatan!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.040
Shuba!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.000
Shuba!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:22.080
Sylph, one mustn't lie on one's back

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:22.080
while wearing a kimono. 

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:22.950
Shbaaa!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:22.790
SHBAAA!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.500
Yes, Mother!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.580
I'm sure you're all tired from ringing in the New Year.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:31.790
No, we're fine. More importantly,

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:31.790
thank you so much for the kimonos.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.450
Thank you very much. 

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.250
No, not at all. Now then...

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.160
Go on, please help yourselves. 

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.290
Thems were some good vittles...

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:50.370
This is no time to be lying about, everyone!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:51.750
Sylphin...?

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:57.750
I've put together various New Years' items

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:57.750
so we can all enjoy this day!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.750
Note: Well-known board and card games, respectively.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.750
Wow! Sugoroku, and Karuta! And kites!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.750
You've got so many things.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.580
Are these well-known?

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.830
You got all these not knowing what they are?

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:09.580
This paddle or what have you is pretty indeed!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.120
Note: A traditional paddle game.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.120
Hanetsuki! I've never seen it before.

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:15.830
This is my first time too!

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:15.830
You don't see it too often, do you?

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.910
We had it back in my house. 

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:22.040
How do you play it? I want to try it, indeed!

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:28.830
Oh, I see. So, basically, it's tennis.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:28.830
I understand completely!

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:33.790
I'm telling you, it's different. It may look like tennis,

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:33.790
but the rules are different.  

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:35.830
You must not allow the shuttlecock to drop. 

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.580
Ah, I see. 

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.410
Those two sure do get along, don't they?

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.290
Yup.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.790
I have learned the rules!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.790
Indeed, now we should form our teams!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:50.410
This is my first time to be on a team with you, Umaru!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.410
Yeah, I guess you're right. 

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:56.120
Let's hurry up and put an end to this. 

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.830
K-Kirie?

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.330
Okay, here goes. One, two...!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:04.790
H-hyaa?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.700
We need only not drop the shuttlecock, yes?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.700
Then, here goes! 

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:12.620
Canzone Sylphin Smash!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.120
What's this? There was no rebound.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.700
A paddle is completely different from a tennis racket.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.450
So then, how about we introduce a game of Penalty?

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.160
A game of Penalty?!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.540
Kirie, what will you draw?

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.410
I-I can't draw! I can't bring shame

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.410
to Umaru's beautiful face!

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.870
Let's stop this! No more Penalty!

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:39.120
But, I want to play this "Penalty Game," indeed!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:43.450
A-all right. Let's do it as a one-on-challenge. 

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.370
It's like an extra inning, yes?

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.330
Ebina, have a seat with me. 

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.870
O-okay. 

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.040
Hyaa!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:58.500
Sylphin said this already, but...

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:01.830
New Years' sure is great, huh?

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:03.040
Yes!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.160
Okay, let’s start with warmups!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.000
Stretch your hands out straight and shake them around!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.830
Here we go! Starting from the right!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:57.830
One, two!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:00.120
Puura puraa, puura puraa, puura puraa puuraa

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:00.120
Shake, shake, shake-shake-shake, shake

