00:20:54.370 --> 00:21:00.370
Ne! Ne! Ne! Tama ni wa ne, oniichan mo boutto minaide sa

00:20:54.370 --> 00:21:00.370
Hey! Hey! Hey! Don't always

00:20:54.370 --> 00:21:00.370
just stand there spacing out, Big Brother

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:04.910
Kou shite issho ni odorou yo

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:04.910
Let's dance together, like THIS

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:09.830
Tanoshiku nai? Tanoshiku naku naku nai?

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:09.830
It's fun, right? It's not NOT fun, right?

