00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.540
Shake, shake, shake-shake-shake, and let's go!

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:22.370
Umaru, here's your New Years' allowance. 

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.620
From Big Brother

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.620
10,000 yen

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.330
For you, Tanukichi.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:26.620
From Bomba

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:26.620
5,000 yen

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.330
Here, Sensei. 

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:29.620
From Alex

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:29.620
20,000 yen

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:31.200
Here, Master!

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.040
No, no, that's fine! 

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.160
All combined, that's 35,000 yen. 

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:40.540
Up till now, I would've just gone and spent all this, but...

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:44.120
this year, you'll find that I'm a SMIDGE different. 

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.450
And so...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:51.450
I gave my greed the smackdown

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:51.450
and decided to save it, Big Brother!  

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.080
Oh.

00:21:52.120 --> 00:22:00.080
Hachioji Bank

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:57.540
I exchanged it all for 500-yen coins,

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:57.540
so it's made me feel kinda sorta rich! 

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.000
You didn't have to change all that for coins, did you?

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:03.080
Still, it's pretty grownup of you to save it all.

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:04.410
I know, right?!

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:11.330
See? This way, it's hard

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:11.330
to spend too much at once, right?

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:14.120
I get it. Yeah, that does make it a pain to get money.

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:17.950
Wh-what's with you?

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:22.950
I was just thinking, maybe you'd like to add to the piggy...

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:25.080
But those are YOUR savings, right?

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:27.540
A few days later

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:27.450
I-it can't be!

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:34.700
Wh-where could my money have gone?

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:34.700
I can't think of a single reason!

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.080
There are way too many reasons!

00:22:43.620 --> 00:22:44.370
This is the end!

00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:45.660
She's really suffering...

00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:45.660
This is the end!

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.370
But this time, I'm not going to help her out.

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.370
It's for her own good. 

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:55.450
What should I do? I promised everyone

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:55.450
we'd all do something together. 

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:07.870
Big Brother!

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:10.370
But just this once.   

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:17.700
Still, in this day and age,

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:17.700
what can I do with only 500 yen?

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.580
Times have changed since you were young, you know. 

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:24.120
Also, YOU may not have any hobbies,

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:28.040
but don't go thinking everyone is the same

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:28.040
and they don't spend money! 

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:31.040
So, how about a bit more for the piggy?

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:34.540
Wh-wh-why you...

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:36.620
HIMOUTO!

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:40.290
I'm sorry, Big Brother!
